<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;I need to be able to stop the sound before reaching the end of the sound file.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SoX also has the &lt;c&gt;trim&lt;/c&gt; operation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
$ play "/home/myname/soundfile.wav" trim 0 5
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should play only the first 5 seconds of your file.&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
